<section id="exp"><h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2><ol class="experience-list"><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title"><span class="incoming-label">Incoming</span>Long-Term Visitor · Simons Institute for the Theory of Computing, UC Berkeley</span><span class="job-dates">Jan–Apr 2027</span></div><p><em>Symmetry in Efficient Computation with Local Constraints</em>.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title"><span class="incoming-label">Incoming</span>Participant, Iliad Intensive · Iliad, Berkeley, CA</span><span class="job-dates">Jan 4–29, 2027</span></div><p>Technical training in foundational AI alignment, including deep learning theory, agent foundations, and interpretability.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Graduate Student Instructor · <a href="https://umich.edu/">University of Michigan</a></span><span class="job-dates">Jan–Apr 2026</span></div><p>EECS 281: Data Structures &amp; Algorithms.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Research Visitor · <a href="https://www.ttic.edu/">Toyota Technological Institute at Chicago</a></span><span class="job-dates">Sep–Oct 2025</span></div><p>Host: Santhoshini Velusamy. Research on streaming complexity and constraint satisfaction problems.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Graduate Student Instructor · <a href="https://umich.edu/">University of Michigan</a></span><span class="job-dates">Aug–Dec 2024</span></div><p>EECS 477: Introduction to Algorithms.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Teaching Assistant · <a href="https://cse.iitkgp.ac.in/">IIT Kharagpur</a></span><span class="job-dates">Jan–Apr 2022</span></div><p><a href="https://cse.iitkgp.ac.in/~palash/Courses/2022Algorithms1-Theory/algo1-2022.html">Algorithms 1</a>.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Teaching Assistant · <a href="https://cse.iitkgp.ac.in/">IIT Kharagpur</a></span><span class="job-dates">Aug–Dec 2021</span></div><p><a href="https://cse.iitkgp.ac.in/~palash/Courses/2021AlgorithmicGameTheory/agt2021.html">Algorithmic Game Theory</a>.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Research Intern · <a href="https://www.cse.iitd.ac.in/~ashishc/">IIT Delhi</a></span><span class="job-dates">Apr–Oct 2021</span></div><p>Host: Ashish Chiplunkar. Research on online algorithms.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Software Engineering Intern · <a href="https://www.oracle.com/in/engineered-systems/exadata/cloud-at-customer/">Oracle R&amp;D, ExaCC</a></span><span class="job-dates">May–Jul 2021</span></div><p>Implemented a Java library for secure HTTP authentication using the Java Cryptography Architecture.</p></li><li class="experience-entry"><div class="experience-heading"><span class="job-title">Research Intern · <a href="https://www.csa.iisc.ac.in/">IISc Bangalore</a></span><span class="job-dates">May–Jul 2019; Dec 2019</span></div><p>Host: Arindam Khan. Research in approximation algorithms and geometric packing.</p></li></ol></section>

