<section id="talks"><h2 class="section-title">Selected talks</h2><ul class="talk-list"><li><div><strong>Characterizing Streaming Decidability of CSPs via Non-Redundancy</strong><p class="talk-meta">ESA 2026</p></div><div class="talk-links"><a href="data/streaming_csp_decidability.pdf">Slides</a></div></li><li><div><strong>Min CSPs on Complete Instances II: A Polylogarithmic Approximation for NAE-3-SAT</strong><p class="talk-meta">APPROX 2025</p></div><div class="talk-links"><a href="data/APPROX_NAE.pdf">Slides</a></div></li><li><div><strong>Min CSPs on Complete Instances</strong><p class="talk-meta">SODA 2025</p></div><div class="talk-links"><a href="data/MinCSPs.pdf">Slides</a></div></li><li><div><strong>On Guillotine Separable Packings for the Two-Dimensional Geometric Knapsack Problem</strong><p class="talk-meta">HALG 2021 · Contributed talk</p></div><div class="talk-links"><a href="data/MONDAY_SHARMA.pdf">Slides</a><a href="data/MONDAY_SHARMA_POSTER.pdf">Poster</a></div></li><li><div><strong>On Parameterized Complexity of Liquid Democracy</strong><p class="talk-meta">CALDAM 2021</p></div><div class="talk-links"><a href="data/ld_caldam.pdf">Slides</a><a href="https://youtu.be/JFnH7nRP6XQ">Video</a></div></li></ul><details class="expandable"><summary>Course presentations</summary><div class="expanded-content"><article class="publication">
        <div>
          <a href="https://youtu.be/jgl-7Kc_ziI" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="images/bidem.jpg" width="150" alt="Bidimensionality"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="publication-content">
          <a href="https://youtu.be/jgl-7Kc_ziI"><h3>Bidimensionality: Parameterized Algorithms</h3></a>
          <p><strong>Amatya Sharma</strong></p>
          <p>
            <em>Parameterized Algorithms (CS60083) Course Presentation, November 2020.</em>
            <span class="publication-icons">
              <a href="https://youtu.be/jgl-7Kc_ziI"><i class="fa fa-video-camera" title="YouTube Link"></i></a>
              <a href="data/bidem.pdf"><i class="fa fa-slideshare" title="PDF Slides"></i></a>
            </span>
          </p>
          <p>Talk on bidimensionality and bidimensional problems, a tool for developing parameterized algorithms via treewidth.</p>
        </div>
      </article><article class="publication">
        <div>
          <a href="https://youtu.be/RCDfGywknZs" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="images/dl_gan.jpg" width="150" alt="DL GAN ECCW"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="publication-content">
          <a href="https://youtu.be/RCDfGywknZs"><h3>Mitigating Dataset Imbalance via Joint Generation & Classification</h3></a>
          <p><strong>Dewang Modi</strong> and <strong>Amatya Sharma</strong></p>
          <p>
